<title>SINGAPORE: SPC appoints new director.</title>
<headline>SPC appoints new director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Petroleum Co Ltd said on Wednesday it appointed Lim Yin Kiat as director with effect from August 6.</p>
<p>Lim is senior vice president (international) with DBS Bank.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870 3080)</p>
</text>
